'''Be Bee Queen (Merciless)''' is the second and final stage in [[The Eldest Queen]]. When clearing the stage, the player unlocks the [[True Form]] of [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], Jelly Dumpling Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

