==Strategy==
An incredibly straightforward stage. All you need to do is meatshield well and bring [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] due to the enemies having no real pusher. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] works wonders in this stage, being able to hit the Rain Ds. from behind the boss. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] also works great, as he does Massive Damage to Floating enemies like Queen Mother V, speeding up the process of killing her.

A high-level [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] can shred Queen Mother V as well as Haniwanwan very fast, meaning that if you can keep Rain D. away, you can have a rapid-attacking stack of Royal Guards chip away very quickly at both the boss and, once she is dead, the base as well.

==='''Strategy 1 (Rush/Cheese)'''===
{{Lineup
