'''Battle:''' Send out Slime Cat as early as possible. Upon receiving the cash drop from Those Guys, summon Awakened Bahamut Cat, then start spamming Crazed Cow Cats and Crazed Cats off cooldown. Do this while gradually stacking Courier Cats on Queen Mother V, that way, once she dies, you'll have the firepower necessary to finish the stage before Angelic Sleipnir ruins everything. (Note that this strategy can easily go wrong, so fill in the remaining slots with units that can help with what you're stuck on).

=== '''Strategy 2 (Rush/Cheese)''' ===
